tml">The disgraced Hollywood mogul was found guilty of sexually assaulting former production assistant Miriam Haley. The man whose case spurred the #MeToo movement awaits a separate sentencing in a California rape case.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>India: LPU suspends classes after violent protests over alleged campus rape</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:905a810c86967f81c485f8db625529cb12487837801e643491a0ab6cd71e4de2</id><updated>2026-10-01T06:10:21Z</updated><published>2026-09-28T08:18:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/india-lpu-suspends-classes-after-violent-protests-over-alleged-campus-rape/live-79454038--f47bda72507a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/india-lpu-suspends-classes-after-violent-protests-over-alleged-campus-rape/live-79454038?maca=en-rss-en-cul-2090-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A university in Punjab has suspended classes after protests over a rumored sexual assault took a violent turn. Separately, the Supreme Court has taken suo motu cognizance of recent rape cases in Delhi.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Servers at Munich's iconic Oktoberfest call for more respect</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:f645a4432a740ead1779825bcfe9e9e7ccf9fe97d3f70c6bd2cd866b2c03072b</id><updated>2026-10-01T06:10:21Z</updated><published>2026-09-30T13:22:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/servers-at-munich-s-iconic-oktoberfest-call-for-more-respect/a-79491207--cd91ce591124.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/servers-at-munich-s-iconic-oktoberfest-call-for-more-respect/a-79491207?maca=en-rss-en-cul-2090-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Oktoberfest is famous the world over for beer, brass band music and Bavarian traditions. But staff at the Wiesn are also reporting incidents of racism and sexism. They're taking a stand against discrimination.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>What would Francis of Assisi make of his fame today?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:c4a7460255f085f15b9119ac800495cff79598bc47ab8d278dc31f187d49c765</id><updated>2026-10-01T06:10:21Z</updated><published>2026-09-28T06:18:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/what-would-francis-of-assisi-make-of-his-fame-today/a-79346151--db42471ab90e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/what-would-francis-of-assisi-make-of-his-fame-today/a-79346151?maca=en-rss-en-cul-2090-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The Catholic saint renounced wealth and fame to become a mendicant friar. Yet throughout history, his teachings and life have inspired popes, Dante and even Mussolini.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>Ireland will boycott Eurovision again because of Israel's participation, but the song contest is still expanding.</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:47bd2038ed2e4f1214e6aebc6696302a7dc91555a5b50eedc162d8a665977c8c</id><updated>2026-10-01T06:10:21Z</updated><published>2026-09-30T09:18:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/ireland-will-boycott-eurovision-again-because-of-israel-s-participation-but-the-song-contest-is-stil/a-79401752--f96894bb90e1.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/ireland-will-boycott-eurovision-again-because-of-israel-s-participation-but-the-song-contest-is-still-expanding/a-79401752?maca=en-rss-en-cul-2090-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The 2026 Eurovision Song Contest was marred by boycotts in protest against Israel's participation in the midst of its war on Gaza. It still aims to keep growing.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>This extremely successful author polarizes German readers</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:ae1210e49270c6443f47d2f6eb7020abe60c30ab8dd1ec06f4c6aaf45ab8ee69</id><updated>2026-10-01T06:10:21Z</updated><published>2026-08-29T07:20:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href