entry><title>Beethoven and Andy Warhol: Rebel icons on show in Bonn</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:a7599c34a92443615c667a304762143efa5cc4bff318bb9bf65498cba565eab8</id><updated>2026-10-01T06:10:21Z</updated><published>2026-09-18T12:57:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/beethoven-and-andy-warhol-rebel-icons-on-show-in-bonn/a-79296944--59ad6d6535a9.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/beethoven-and-andy-warhol-rebel-icons-on-show-in-bonn/a-79296944?maca=en-rss-en-cul-2090-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The new exhibition "Beethoven by Warhol" at the Beethoven House in Bonn presents the pop artist's late masterpiece: a picture of Ludwig van Beethoven. The exhibition shares the story of the work with the public.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>Pay to ghost your boss: Japan's resignation business</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:dcb0f83845acf5a3d77e57853164a016ee2d9cea82e0e0f74b778b296e40a471</id><updated>2026-10-01T06:10:21Z</updated><published>2026-09-14T10:36:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/pay-to-ghost-your-boss-japan-s-resignation-business/a-79213584--1937a091cd92.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/pay-to-ghost-your-boss-japan-s-resignation-business/a-79213584?maca=en-rss-en-cul-2090-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Resignation agencies in Japan help employees leave their jobs seamlessly in just 15 minutes. Young people are especially eager to use their services.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Could flattering AI make humanity turn on itself?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:f903ffa3f4133c63fbe4c13035e48f969d12ebbc709d11ab0a15532fc01b6f6e</id><updated>2026-10-01T06:10:21Z</updated><published>2026-09-24T13:10:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/could-flattering-ai-make-humanity-turn-on-itself/a-79377894--285f77843c72.html" type="text/html" /><link rel=